      71.25,
      374.17,
      532.03,
      385.24
    ],
    "text": "WAGES BOARD FOR THE RUBBER CULTIVATION AND RAW RUBBER PROCESSING TRADE",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      56.13,
      398.17,
      547.23,
      445.24
    ],
    "text": "IN accordance with Section 28 of the wages Boards Ordinance (chapter 136), the Wages Board of the Rubber Cultivationand Raw Rubber Processing Trade hereby notifies that the board by virtue of powers vested in it by Section 30 of theaforesaid Ordinance propose to vary in the manner set out in the schedule here to such decisions of the Board as arespecified in that schedule.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      56.13,
      458.17,
      547.31,
      481.24
    ],
    "text": "Objections to the aforesaid proposal will be received by the Chairman of the Board until 12.00 noon on 31stMarch 2016.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      56.13,
      494.17,
      547.23,
      517.24
    ],
    "text": "Every such objection must be made in writing and must contain a statement of the grounds upon which suchobjection is taken.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      403.41,
      542.17,
      500.83,
